# TARGET ARCHITECTURE: x86_64 | v0.16.2 | aws/ubuntu2404
# Enterprise Linux Audit v0.16.2  |  [aws/ubuntu2404]
# Tier: tier-2-core-security
# Purpose: package repository tampering
# Source/authority: Enterprise SOC/IR minimum; distro package manager vendor documentation
# Architecture: x86_64 (b64 native, b32 compatibility); use aarch64/ subprofile for ARM64.
# Release state: engineering candidate; NOT independently certified STIG compliant.


-a always,exit -F arch=b64 -F dir=/etc/apt -F perm=wa -k t2_pkg_repo
# Capture apt/dpkg transactions through OS package logs as a companion data source.
